            "text": "<p>3 NIGHTS. 2 DAYS. 1 BREAKTHROUGH.</p><p>That's all it takes.</p><p>Join Jason Shurka, Dr. Bryan Ardis, Dr. Edward Group, Sir Robert Edward Grant, Aaron Abke, and Peter Heibloem in Miami, FL this upcoming January 16-18 2026 for an incredible immersive experience that will change your life forever.</p>"
          }
