            "dropdown_text": "<p>Understanding Your Reality, Mapping Your Mind’s Program, Facing Your Triggers, Identifying Your Limiting Beliefs, and Facing Your Hardships.</p><p>8:00 AM - 9:00AM: TLS Experience Center & Vendor Network </p><p>9:00AM - 9:45AM: Morning Kickoff with Pete Heibloem & Empowerment Session with Jason Shurka</p><p>9:45AM - 12:00PM: Session 1 with Jason Shurka “Mastering The Fundamental Laws Of The Universe”</p><p>12:00PM - 2:00PM: Lunch (on your own), TLS Experience Center, & Vendor Network</p><p>2:00PM - 4:00PM: Session 2 with Robert Edward Grant “From Self-Limitations To Highest Expression Through Gene Keys & Astrology”</p><p>4:00PM - 5:00PM: TLS Experience Center & Vendor Network</p><p>5:00PM - 5:15PM: Meditation Integration with Aaron Abke</p><p>5:15PM - 6:30PM: Session 3 with Aaron Abke \"Brain Wave Mastery\"</p><p>6:30PM - 7:00PM: Closing Remarks with Jason Shurka​</p><p>7:00PM - 8:00PM: TLS Experience Center & Vendor Network</p>",
