    "text_columns_RwtVXy": {
      "type": "text-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_iw736L": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": false,
            "image_mask": "rounded",
            "image_width": 320,
            "title": "",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Robert Edward Grant is a serial entrepreneur, polymath, prolific inventor, and thought leader in fields ranging from medical technology and cryptography to sacred geometry, mathematics, and music theory. With over 80 patents to his name, Grant is known for bridging the gap between science, spirituality, and innovation, applying his deep understanding of sacred geometry and universal mathematical principles to solve problems across diverse industries.</p><p><br/>Robert Edward Grant is a polymath, inventor, entrepreneur, mathematician, and philosopher whose work spans multiple fields, including healthcare, cryptography, sacred geometry, music theory, and consciousness studies. His remarkable ability to integrate ancient wisdom with modern science has earned him recognition as a visionary in both business and spiritual philosophy. Over the course of his career, Grant has founded and led numerous successful companies, contributed to cutting-edge research in cryptography and mathematics, and developed groundbreaking theories that merge the realms of spirituality and science.<br/>​<br/>Additionally, Robert serves or has served on the boards of the following university and charitable organizations: The Schmid College of Chapman University, the University of California, Irvine (UCI) CEO Roundtable Steering Committee, The School of Law at UCI, The Henry Samueli School of Engineering, OCTANe (501-C3 non-profit entity) an economic development corporation for technology companies in Orange County, California where he served as Chairman of the Board of Directors, and the Young Presidents’ Organization (YPO/WPO) Southern California Chapter where he formerly served as Chairman of the Board. Mr. Grant was the 2023 recipient of the Lifetime Achievement Award (Business and Philanthropy) from Calstate Fullerton University. In 2023, Robert Edward Grant was Knighted by the sovereign nation of Montenegro and then, once more, was Knighted by Portugal in 2024.<br/></p>",
            "align_text": "left",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_MjVTh6": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Robert-Press.jpg",
            "image_mask": "rounded",
            "image_width": 410,
            "title": "Robert Edward Grant",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "text": "",
            "align_text": "center",
