    "testimonials_bny9Uj": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_ad7x6A": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>This was a “shifting” event for me maybe not a transformation. But I was feeling stuck and I am less stuck now. The fog of aloneness has cleared. For me, the most powerful part was being around other like-minded people. But I have really come to realize that each and everyone of us at the event we’re probably the expanders of our own circle back home. it was very powerful to come be around other expanders and contractors to help find a new center. For me a center of peace.</p>",
            "author": "Jeannie Katz",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_48XjWX": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>The Transformation Workshop was really transformational as everything hit home by helping me connect the dots as I integrated the experience. It felt so magical to be transported by so much love and unity. A sense of belonging !</p>",
            "author": "Josiane Vicini",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_3NpwMp": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>Fan of The TRANSFORMATION Event. There were great nuggets of information I could utilize to reprogram the mind. The interaction with the audience made the event even better and very heartwarming. 🧠 After watching the event, I noticed a shift in my mindset, and I'm a bit more mindful of my interactions with people so there's something going on here. 🙌 Highly recommended. Worth the investment, especially if you plan on watching it repetitively.</p>",
            "author": "Joseph Dream",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_FnhFpK": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>I’ve been in the healing field for several years. I’ve been dedicated to continual massive expansion. I was pleasantly surprised by the content of this event. The combination of Jason’s teaching and Damien’s healing techniques were exponential. Also the safe space of non-judgment and unconditional love that was held for all was evident as we witnessed such deeply personal stories from the participants in stage. I’m 3 days into integration of the full experience.</p>",
            "author": "Sandra Parks",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_686PVL": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>Jason is doing some truly important work for humanity in building the Unifyd network to educate and enlighten, and the experience and knowledge delivered in the in-person Transformation event was genuinely powerful. Something pinged me pretty significantly in telling me that I needed to be there at this event when it was announced, and I'm so glad I heeded my inner guidance on this one. I had an amazing experience. Together we rise!</p>",
            "author": "RJ Pickens",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "testimonial_ad7x6A",
